:root{
  --bg:#020604;
  --bg-2:#06100b;
  --panel:rgba(10,24,16,.62);
  --panel-solid:#0a1811;
  --line:rgba(62,224,122,.16);
  --line-strong:rgba(62,224,122,.38);
  --g-deep:#0b5a2c;
  --g:#1fb05a;
  --g-bright:#3ee07a;
  --g-glow:#8cffb4;
  --gold:#c9a857;
  --text:#e8f3ec;
  --muted:#93a89b;
  --dim:#5d7266;
  --radius:18px;
  --font:"Space Grotesk",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  --mono:"JetBrains Mono",ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
  --ease:cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;overflow-x:hidden}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--font);line-height:1.6;overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
img,svg{display:block;max-width:100%}
::selection{background:var(--g);color:#021008}

/* ---------- cosmic background ---------- */
#cosmos{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:-2;pointer-events:none}
.nebula{position:fixed;inset:-20%;z-index:-3;pointer-events:none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(40% 35% at 78% 18%,rgba(31,176,90,.20),transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(35% 40% at 12% 72%,rgba(11,90,44,.30),transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(30% 25% at 55% 55%,rgba(201,168,87,.06),transparent 70%),
    var(--bg);
  animation:nebula 40s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
@keyframes nebula{to{transform:translate3d(-3%,2%,0) scale(1.06)}}
.cursor-glow{position:fixed;width:520px;height:520px;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:-1;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(62,224,122,.10),transparent 65%);transform:translate(-50%,-50%);transition:opacity .4s;opacity:0}

/* ---------- layout ---------- */
.wrap{width:min(1160px,100% - 40px);margin-inline:auto}
section{padding:110px 0 40px;position:relative}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--g-bright);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.eyebrow::before{content:"";width:28px;height:1px;background:var(--g-bright);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--g-bright)}
h2.title{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.4vw,3.1rem);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:14px 0 18px;font-weight:700}
h2.title em{font-style:normal;color:var(--g-bright);text-shadow:0 0 28px rgba(62,224,122,.45)}
.lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:640px;font-size:1.05rem}

/* ---------- nav ---------- */
.nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:50;transition:background .4s,border-color .4s,backdrop-filter .4s;border-bottom:1px solid transparent}
.nav.scrolled{background:rgba(2,6,4,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-color:var(--line)}
.nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:72px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em}
.brand img{width:40px;height:40px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(62,224,122,.5));transition:transform .8s var(--ease)}
.brand:hover img{transform:rotate(60deg)}
.brand span small{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.18em}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:6px;list-style:none}
.nav-links a{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;transition:color .25s,background .25s}
.nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a.active{color:var(--text);background:rgba(62,224,122,.08)}
.nav-cta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;padding:9px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:999px;color:var(--g-bright);transition:all .3s}
.nav-cta:hover{background:var(--g);color:#021008;box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(62,224,122,.5)}
.menu-btn{display:none;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);color:var(--text);width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer}
.menu-btn span{display:block;width:18px;height:2px;background:currentColor;margin:4px auto;transition:.3s}

/* ---------- hero ---------- */
.hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;padding-top:100px}
.hero .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}
.status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--panel)}
.status i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--g-bright);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--g-bright);animation:pulse 2s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{50%{opacity:.35;transform:scale(.8)}}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,8.5vw,6.4rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:26px 0 18px;font-weight:700}
.hero h1 .line{display:block;overflow:hidden}
.hero h1 .line span{display:inline-block;transform:translateY(110%);animation:rise 1.1s var(--ease) forwards}
.hero h1 .line:nth-child(2) span{animation-delay:.12s}
.hero h1 .outline{color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px var(--g-bright);text-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(62,224,122,.25)}
@keyframes rise{to{transform:none}}
.role{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:clamp(.95rem,2vw,1.15rem);color:var(--g-glow);min-height:1.6em}
.role .caret{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:1.1em;background:var(--g-bright);vertical-align:-3px;margin-left:3px;animation:blink 1s steps(1) infinite}
@keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}
.hero p.lead{margin:22px 0 34px}
.btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px}
.btn{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:14px;font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .3s var(--ease),box-shadow .3s}
.btn svg{width:18px;height:18px}
.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--g-bright),var(--g));color:#021008;box-shadow:0 10px 40px -10px rgba(62,224,122,.7)}
.btn-primary::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(110deg,transparent 30%,rgba(255,255,255,.45) 50%,transparent 70%);transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform .8s}
.btn-primary:hover::after{transform:translateX(100%)}
.btn-ghost{border:1px solid var(--line-strong);color:var(--text);background:var(--panel)}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--g-bright);box-shadow:0 0 30px -6px rgba(62,224,122,.5)}

/* hero emblem */
.emblem{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1;width:min(440px,100%);margin-inline:auto}
.emblem .ring{position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.emblem .r1{inset:0;border-style:dashed;border-color:rgba(62,224,122,.25);animation:spin 60s linear infinite}
.emblem .r2{inset:9%;border:2px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--g-bright);border-bottom-color:var(--g-deep);animation:spin 14s linear infinite reverse;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px var(--g-bright))}
.emblem .r3{inset:18%;background:conic-gradient(from 0deg,transparent 0 20%,rgba(62,224,122,.25) 25%,transparent 30% 70%,rgba(62,224,122,.25) 75%,transparent 80%);animation:spin 8s linear infinite}
.emblem .core{position:absolute;inset:26%;animation:float 6s ease-in-out infinite}
.emblem .core img{width:100%;height:100%;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(62,224,122,.55))}
.emblem .orbit{position:absolute;inset:0;animation:spin 20s linear infinite}
.emblem .orbit b{position:absolute;top:-6px;left:50%;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--g-glow);box-shadow:0 0 18px 4px var(--g-bright)}
.emblem .chip{position:absolute;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--panel-solid);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);color:var(--g-glow);animation:float 5s ease-in-out infinite;white-space:nowrap}
.emblem .c1{top:8%;left:-4%}
.emblem .c2{top:44%;right:-8%;animation-delay:-1.5s}
.emblem .c3{bottom:6%;left:6%;animation-delay:-3s}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
@keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-12px)}}
.scroll-hint{position:absolute;bottom:28px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.3em;color:var(--dim);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.scroll-hint::after{content:"";width:1px;height:44px;background:linear-gradient(var(--g-bright),transparent);animation:drip 2s infinite}
@keyframes drip{0%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:top}50%{transform:scaleY(1);transform-origin:top}51%{transform-origin:bottom}100%{transform:scaleY(0);transform-origin:bottom}}

/* ---------- marquee ---------- */
.marquee{border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 0;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(6,16,11,.5)}
.marquee-track{display:flex;gap:48px;width:max-content;animation:marq 38s linear infinite}
.marquee span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:48px;white-space:nowrap}
.marquee span::after{content:"\2B21";color:var(--g)}
@keyframes marq{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

/* ---------- panels ---------- */
.panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);position:relative}
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:26px;margin-top:40px}
.about-text{padding:34px}
.about-text p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px}
.about-text p strong{color:var(--text);font-weight:600}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}
.stat{padding:26px;overflow:hidden}
.stat .num{font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--g-bright);text-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(62,224,122,.35)}
.stat .lbl{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted)}
.edu{grid-column:1/-1;padding:24px 28px;display:grid;gap:14px}
.edu-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.edu-row b{display:block}
.edu-row span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
.edu-row .right{text-align:right;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.85rem;color:var(--g-glow)}

/* ---------- projects ---------- */
.projects{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:24px;margin-top:44px}
.card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:30px;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .5s var(--ease),border-color .4s,box-shadow .4s;transform-style:preserve-3d;will-change:transform}
.card::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:inherit;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(420px circle at var(--mx,50%) var(--my,0%),rgba(62,224,122,.14),transparent 45%);opacity:0;transition:opacity .4s}
.card:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong);box-shadow:0 30px 70px -30px rgba(62,224,122,.35)}
.card:hover::before{opacity:1}
.card.featured{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:30px;align-items:center}
.card-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:22px}
.card-idx{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--dim)}
.badge{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);color:var(--g-glow);background:rgba(62,224,122,.06)}
.badge.gold{border-color:rgba(201,168,87,.5);color:var(--gold);background:rgba(201,168,87,.07)}
.card h3{font-size:1.45rem;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:12px}
.card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:22px}
.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:24px}
.tags span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted)}
.card .more{margin-top:auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--g-bright)}
.card .more svg{width:18px;transition:transform .3s}
.card:hover .more svg{transform:translateX(6px)}
.card-visual{aspect-ratio:16/11;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(160deg,#07140d,#030a06);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.card-visual svg{width:100%;height:100%}
.flow{stroke-dasharray:6 8;animation:flow 1.4s linear infinite}
@keyframes flow{to{stroke-dashoffset:-28}}
.wave{animation:wave 2.4s ease-out infinite;transform-origin:center;transform-box:fill-box}
.wave.d2{animation-delay:.8s}.wave.d3{animation-delay:1.6s}
@keyframes wave{0%{opacity:.9;transform:scale(.3)}100%{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.6)}}

/* ---------- skills ---------- */
.skills-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:44px}
.skill{padding:26px}
.skill .ico{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:rgba(62,224,122,.08);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--g-bright)}
.skill .ico svg{width:24px;height:24px}
.skill h4{font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:12px}
.skill ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px}
.skill li{font-size:.8rem;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:7px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted)}

/* ---------- timeline ---------- */
.two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px;margin-top:44px}
.timeline{padding:30px}
.timeline h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.timeline h3 svg{width:20px;color:var(--g-bright)}
.tl-item{position:relative;padding-left:26px;padding-bottom:22px;border-left:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
.tl-item:last-child{padding-bottom:0}
.tl-item::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-6px;top:4px;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--g-bright);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--g-bright)}
.tl-item b{display:block;font-size:.98rem}
.tl-item span{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)}
.cert-list{display:grid;gap:10px}
.cert{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);transition:border-color .3s,transform .3s}
.cert:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong);transform:translateX(4px)}
.cert i{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.68rem;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(62,224,122,.1);color:var(--g-glow);min-width:64px;text-align:center}
.cert span{font-size:.9rem}
.trophy{margin-top:18px;padding:18px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid rgba(201,168,87,.35);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(201,168,87,.08),transparent);display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start}
.trophy svg{width:26px;flex:none;color:var(--gold)}
.trophy b{color:var(--gold)}
.trophy p{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)}

/* ---------- contact ---------- */
.contact{text-align:center;padding:60px 30px;overflow:hidden}
.contact h2.title{margin-inline:auto;max-width:760px}
.contact .lead{margin:0 auto 38px}
.contact-links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:10px}
.clink{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:22px 14px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);transition:all .35s var(--ease)}
.clink svg{width:26px;height:26px;color:var(--g-bright);transition:transform .35s}
.clink b{font-size:.95rem}
.clink span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);word-break:break-all}
.clink:hover{border-color:var(--g-bright);transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 20px 50px -20px rgba(62,224,122,.55)}
.clink:hover svg{transform:scale(1.15)}

footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:80px;padding:30px 0}
footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--dim)}
footer .f-links{display:flex;gap:18px}
footer .f-links a:hover{color:var(--g-bright)}

/* ---------- reveal ---------- */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px);transition:opacity 1s var(--ease),transform 1s var(--ease)}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.reveal.d1{transition-delay:.1s}.reveal.d2{transition-delay:.2s}.reveal.d3{transition-delay:.3s}

/* ---------- project detail pages ---------- */
.p-hero{padding:150px 0 50px}
.back{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:28px;transition:color .3s,gap .3s}
.back:hover{color:var(--g-bright);gap:12px}
.back svg{width:16px}
.p-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,6vw,4.4rem);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:18px 0 20px;max-width:900px}
.p-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--g-bright);text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(62,224,122,.4)}
.p-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:40px}
.p-meta div{padding:18px 20px}
.p-meta small{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:6px}
.p-meta b{font-size:.95rem}
.p-diagram{margin-top:30px;padding:24px;overflow:hidden}
.p-diagram svg{width:100%;height:auto}
.p-diagram svg text{font-family:var(--mono);fill:var(--text)}
.p-diagram .cap{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--dim);margin-top:12px;text-align:center}
.p-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:24px}
.p-block{padding:30px}
.p-block.full{grid-column:1/-1}
.p-block h3{font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.p-block h3::before{content:"";width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--g-bright);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--g-bright);transform:rotate(45deg)}
.p-block p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}
.p-block ul{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:10px}
.p-block li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;color:var(--muted)}
.p-block li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.62em;width:10px;height:1px;background:var(--g-bright)}
.p-block li b{color:var(--text);font-weight:600}
.steps{counter-reset:s;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}
.step{padding:22px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);counter-increment:s}
.step::before{content:"0" counter(s);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--g-bright);display:block;margin-bottom:10px}
.step b{display:block;margin-bottom:6px}
.step span{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)}
.hw{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.92rem}
.hw td{padding:12px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
.hw td:first-child{font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--g-glow);white-space:nowrap;padding-right:18px}
.hw td:last-child{color:var(--muted)}
.hw tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
.p-nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:40px}
.p-nav a{padding:24px 28px;transition:border-color .3s,transform .3s}
.p-nav a:hover{border-color:var(--g-bright);transform:translateY(-4px)}
.p-nav small{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}
.p-nav b{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:1.05rem}
.p-nav a:last-child{text-align:right}
.note{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);padding:16px 20px;border-left:2px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(201,168,87,.05);border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;margin-top:14px}

/* ---------- responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width:980px){
  .hero .wrap,.about-grid,.card.featured,.two-col,.p-body{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .emblem{width:min(340px,86%);order:-1}
  .skills-grid,.contact-links,.p-meta,.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .projects{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media (max-width:760px){
  .nav-links,.nav-cta{display:none}
  .menu-btn{display:block}
  .nav.open .nav-links{display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:absolute;top:72px;left:0;right:0;background:rgba(2,6,4,.96);padding:18px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  section{padding:80px 0 30px}
  .hero{padding-top:110px}
  .emblem .chip{display:none}
  .about-text,.card,.timeline,.p-block{padding:22px}
  .p-nav{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .p-nav a:last-child{text-align:left}
}
@media (max-width:520px){
  .wrap{width:calc(100% - 32px)}
  .skills-grid,.contact-links,.stats,.p-meta,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .edu-row .right{text-align:left}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.001ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.001ms!important}
  .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}
  .hero h1 .line span{transform:none}
}

(() => {
  const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

  /* ---------- cosmic starfield ---------- */
  const canvas = document.getElementById('cosmos');
  if (canvas) {
    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
    let w, h, dpr, stars = [], shooters = [], scrollY = 0, mx = 0, my = 0;
    const layers = [
      { n: 220, size: [0.3, 0.9], speed: 0.02, par: 0.05 },
      { n: 110, size: [0.7, 1.4], speed: 0.05, par: 0.12 },
      { n: 40,  size: [1.2, 2.2], speed: 0.09, par: 0.22 }
    ];
    const rand = (a, b) => a + Math.random() * (b - a);
    function resize() {
      dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);
      w = canvas.width = innerWidth * dpr;
      h = canvas.height = innerHeight * dpr;
      canvas.style.width = innerWidth + 'px';
      canvas.style.height = innerHeight + 'px';
      stars = [];
      const area = (innerWidth * innerHeight) / (1440 * 900);
      layers.forEach((L, li) => {
        for (let i = 0; i < Math.round(L.n * Math.max(area, .35)); i++) {
          const green = Math.random() < 0.28;
          stars.push({
            x: Math.random() * w, y: Math.random() * h,
            r: rand(L.size[0], L.size[1]) * dpr, L: li,
            tw: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2, tws: rand(0.005, 0.03),
            c: green ? [140, 255, 180] : (Math.random() < 0.1 ? [230, 210, 150] : [235, 245, 240])
          });
        }
      });
    }
    function shoot() {
      if (reduce) return;
      shooters.push({ x: rand(w * .2, w), y: rand(0, h * .4), vx: -rand(8, 14) * dpr, vy: rand(3, 6) * dpr, life: 1 });
      setTimeout(shoot, rand(3500, 8000));
    }
    function frame() {
      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);
      for (const s of stars) {
        const L = layers[s.L];
        s.tw += s.tws;
        const a = 0.45 + Math.sin(s.tw) * 0.4;
        let y = (s.y - scrollY * L.par * dpr) % h; if (y < 0) y += h;
        const x = s.x + mx * L.par * 40 * dpr;
        if (!reduce) s.y += L.speed * dpr * 0.3;
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(${s.c[0]},${s.c[1]},${s.c[2]},${Math.max(a, .05)})`;
        ctx.arc(x, y, s.r, 0, Math.PI * 2);
        ctx.fill();
        if (s.r > 1.6 * dpr) {
          ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(${s.c[0]},${s.c[1]},${s.c[2]},${a * .12})`;
          ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(x, y, s.r * 4, 0, Math.PI * 2); ctx.fill();
        }
      }
      shooters = shooters.filter(sh => sh.life > 0);
      for (const sh of shooters) {
        const g = ctx.createLinearGradient(sh.x, sh.y, sh.x - sh.vx * 10, sh.y - sh.vy * 10);
        g.addColorStop(0, `rgba(170,255,200,${sh.life})`);
        g.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(62,224,122,0)');
        ctx.strokeStyle = g; ctx.lineWidth = 1.6 * dpr;
        ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(sh.x, sh.y); ctx.lineTo(sh.x - sh.vx * 10, sh.y - sh.vy * 10); ctx.stroke();
        sh.x += sh.vx; sh.y += sh.vy; sh.life -= 0.018;
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(frame);
    }
    resize();
    addEventListener('resize', resize);
    addEventListener('scroll', () => { scrollY = window.scrollY; }, { passive: true });
    addEventListener('mousemove', e => { mx = e.clientX / innerWidth - .5; my = e.clientY / innerHeight - .5; });
    frame();
    setTimeout(shoot, 2000);
  }

  /* ---------- cursor glow ---------- */
  const glow = document.querySelector('.cursor-glow');
  if (glow && matchMedia('(pointer:fine)').matches) {
    addEventListener('mousemove', e => {
      glow.style.opacity = 1;
      glow.style.left = e.clientX + 'px';
      glow.style.top = e.clientY + 'px';
    });
  }

  /* ---------- nav ---------- */
  const nav = document.querySelector('.nav');
  const onScroll = () => nav && nav.classList.toggle('scrolled', scrollY > 30);
  addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true }); onScroll();
  const menuBtn = document.querySelector('.menu-btn');
  if (menuBtn) {
    menuBtn.addEventListener('click', () => nav.classList.toggle('open'));
    document.querySelectorAll('.nav-links a').forEach(a => a.addEventListener('click', () => nav.classList.remove('open')));
  }

  /* active nav link */
  const sections = [...document.querySelectorAll('section[id]')];
  const links = [...document.querySelectorAll('.nav-links a[href^="#"]')];
  if (sections.length && links.length) {
    const io = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
      entries.forEach(en => {
        if (en.isIntersecting) links.forEach(l => l.classList.toggle('active', l.getAttribute('href') === '#' + en.target.id));
      });
    }, { rootMargin: '-45% 0px -50% 0px' });
    sections.forEach(s => io.observe(s));
  }

  /* ---------- reveal on scroll ---------- */
  const rev = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
    entries.forEach(en => { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('in'); rev.unobserve(en.target); } });
  }, { threshold: 0.12 });
  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => rev.observe(el));

  /* ---------- typed roles ---------- */
  const typed = document.getElementById('typed');
  if (typed) {
    const roles = ['Embedded Systems Engineer', 'VLSI Enthusiast', 'IoT & Sensor Interfacing', 'Hardware + Firmware Builder'];
    let r = 0, i = 0, del = false;
    const tick = () => {
      const word = roles[r];
      typed.textContent = word.slice(0, i);
      if (!del && i < word.length) i++;
      else if (del && i > 0) i--;
      else if (!del) { del = true; return setTimeout(tick, 1600); }
      else { del = false; r = (r + 1) % roles.length; }
      setTimeout(tick, del ? 35 : 75);
    };
    reduce ? (typed.textContent = roles[0]) : tick();
  }

  /* ---------- counters ---------- */
  const cio = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
    entries.forEach(en => {
      if (!en.isIntersecting) return;
      const el = en.target, end = parseFloat(el.dataset.count), dec = (el.dataset.count.split('.')[1] || '').length;
      const suffix = el.dataset.suffix || '';
      const t0 = performance.now(), dur = 1600;
      const step = t => {
        const p = Math.min((t - t0) / dur, 1), e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3);
        el.textContent = (end * e).toFixed(dec) + suffix;
        if (p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
      };
      reduce ? (el.textContent = end.toFixed(dec) + suffix) : requestAnimationFrame(step);
      cio.unobserve(el);
    });
  }, { threshold: .6 });
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-count]').forEach(el => cio.observe(el));

  /* ---------- card tilt + spotlight ---------- */
  if (!reduce && matchMedia('(pointer:fine)').matches) {
    document.querySelectorAll('.card, .skill, .stat').forEach(card => {
      card.addEventListener('mousemove', e => {
        const b = card.getBoundingClientRect();
        const x = (e.clientX - b.left) / b.width, y = (e.clientY - b.top) / b.height;
        card.style.setProperty('--mx', x * 100 + '%');
        card.style.setProperty('--my', y * 100 + '%');
        card.style.transform = `perspective(1000px) rotateX(${(0.5 - y) * 5}deg) rotateY(${(x - 0.5) * 5}deg) translateY(-4px)`;
      });
      card.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => { card.style.transform = ''; });
    });
  }

  /* year */
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-year]').forEach(el => el.textContent = new Date().getFullYear());
})();

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Vector Aid: V2V Ambulance Alert | Rajeswari T</title>
<meta name="description" content="Vector Aid: a V2V ambulance alert system on Raspberry Pi 4 nodes linked by nRF24L01 RF.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#020604">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="../assets/logo.svg">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="nebula"></div>
<canvas id="cosmos"></canvas>
<div class="cursor-glow"></div>
<header class="nav">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="../index.html" class="brand"><img src="../assets/logo.svg" alt="Rajeswari T logo"><span>RAJESWARI T<small>EMBEDDED // ECE</small></span></a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="../index.html#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="../index.html#projects" class="active">Projects</a></li>
      <li><a href="../index.html#skills">Skills</a></li>
      <li><a href="../index.html#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
    <a href="../assets/Rajeswari_T_Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="nav-cta">Resume ↗</a>
    <button class="menu-btn" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span></button>
  </div>
</header>
<main>
<section class="p-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="../index.html#projects" class="back"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M11 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg> All projects</a>
    <div class="eyebrow reveal">P/01 · Final year project</div>
    <h1 class="reveal d1">Vector Aid: clearing the road <em>before the siren arrives.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead reveal d2">A vehicle-to-vehicle RF system that lets an ambulance tell the vehicles ahead where it is, where it's heading and which route it will take, so drivers can make way early instead of reacting at the last second.</p>
    <div class="p-meta"><div class="panel reveal d0"><small>Type</small><b>Team → Final Year Project</b></div><div class="panel reveal d1"><small>Platform</small><b>Raspberry Pi 4 Model B</b></div><div class="panel reveal d2"><small>Link</small><b>nRF24L01 · 2.4 GHz RF</b></div><div class="panel reveal d3"><small>Domain</small><b>V2V · Smart mobility</b></div></div>
    <div class="panel p-diagram reveal"><svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="System architecture diagram">
<defs>
<marker id="arr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="#3ee07a"/></marker>
<filter id="glow" x="-30%" y="-30%" width="160%" height="160%"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="4" result="b"/><feMerge><feMergeNode in="b"/><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/></feMerge></filter>
</defs><g><rect x="30" y="30" width="170" height="58" rx="10" fill="#08140d" stroke="rgba(62,224,122,.45)" stroke-width="1.4"/><text x="115.0" y="53.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="500">NEO-M8N GPS</text><text x="115.0" y="72.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#93a89b" style="fill:#93a89b">position · speed</text></g><g><rect x="30" y="136" width="170" height="58" rx="10" fill="#08140d" stroke="rgba(62,224,122,.45)" stroke-width="1.4"/><text x="115.0" y="159.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="500">MPU6050</text><text x="115.0" y="178.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#93a89b" style="fill:#93a89b">heading</text></g><g><rect x="30" y="242" width="170" height="58" rx="10" fill="#08140d" stroke="rgba(62,224,122,.45)" stroke-width="1.4"/><text x="115.0" y="265.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="500">OpenRouteService</text><text x="115.0" y="284.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#93a89b" style="fill:#93a89b">route API</text></g><g><rect x="290" y="110" width="190" height="110" rx="10" fill="#0d2417" stroke="#3ee07a" stroke-width="1.4" filter="url(#glow)"/><text x="385.0" y="159.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="500">Raspberry Pi 4</text><text x="385.0" y="178.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#93a89b" style="fill:#93a89b">ambulance node (TX)</text></g><g><rect x="700" y="110" width="170" height="110" rx="10" fill="#0d2417" stroke="#3ee07a" stroke-width="1.4" filter="url(#glow)"/><text x="785.0" y="159.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="500">Raspberry Pi 4</text><text x="785.0" y="178.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#93a89b" style="fill:#93a89b">vehicle unit (RX)</text></g><path d="M200 59 C245 59 245 140 288 140" fill="none" stroke="rgba(62,224,122,.25)" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M200 59 C245 59 245 140 288 140" fill="none" stroke="#3ee07a" stroke-width="2" class="flow" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><path d="M200 165 H288" fill="none" stroke="rgba(62,224,122,.25)" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M200 165 H288" fill="none" stroke="#3ee07a" stroke-width="2" class="flow" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><path d="M200 271 C245 271 245 190 288 190" fill="none" stroke="rgba(62,224,122,.25)" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M200 271 C245 271 245 190 288 190" fill="none" stroke="#3ee07a" stroke-width="2" class="flow" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><path d="M480 165 H698" fill="none" stroke="rgba(62,224,122,.25)" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M480 165 H698" fill="none" stroke="#3ee07a" stroke-width="2" class="flow" marker-end="url(#arr)"/><text x="590" y="124" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" style="fill:#8cffb4">nRF24L01 · 2.4 GHz</text><circle cx="560" cy="165" r="26" fill="none" stroke="#3ee07a" stroke-width="1.2" class="wave"/><circle cx="560" cy="165" r="26" fill="none" stroke="#3ee07a" stroke-width="1.2" class="wave d2"/><circle cx="560" cy="165" r="26" fill="none" stroke="#3ee07a" stroke-width="1.2" class="wave d3"/><text x="785" y="255" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" style="fill:#c9a857">⚠ ambulance approaching</text></svg><div class="cap">Fig. 1: Ambulance node fuses GPS, heading and route data, then broadcasts it to vehicle units over RF.</div></div>
    <div class="p-body"><div class="panel p-block reveal"><h3>The problem</h3><p>In dense city traffic, a siren is heard late and gives no direction. Drivers can't tell whether the ambulance is behind them, crossing ahead or taking another road, so lanes clear slowly and unpredictably.</p><p>Every minute lost in transit matters for emergency patients.</p></div><div class="panel p-block reveal"><h3>The idea</h3><p>Give the ambulance a digital voice. Instead of relying on sound, it broadcasts its live position, heading and planned route directly to nearby vehicles over a short-range RF link, and each vehicle unit decides whether to alert its driver.</p></div><div class="panel p-block reveal full"><h3>How it works</h3><div class="steps"><div class="step"><b>Locate</b><span>The NEO-M8N GPS module provides live position and speed on the ambulance node.</span></div><div class="step"><b>Orient</b><span>An MPU6050 motion sensor supplies heading so direction of travel is known.</span></div><div class="step"><b>Route</b><span>OpenRouteService returns the ambulance's planned path to its destination.</span></div><div class="step"><b>Broadcast</b><span>The Raspberry Pi packages the data and transmits it over nRF24L01 to receiver units in range.</span></div></div></div><div class="panel p-block reveal"><h3>Hardware stack</h3><table class="hw"><tr><td>Raspberry Pi 4</td><td>Model B, 4 GB. One board per node (transmitter and receiver)</td></tr><tr><td>nRF24L01</td><td>2.4 GHz RF transceiver with base board for the V2V link</td></tr><tr><td>NEO-M8N</td><td>GNSS module for position and speed</td></tr><tr><td>MPU6050</td><td>IMU (HW-123 board) for heading</td></tr><tr><td>OpenRouteService</td><td>Routing API for the ambulance's planned path</td></tr></table></div><div class="panel p-block reveal"><h3>Engineering decisions</h3><ul><li><b>Direct RF, not cloud:</b> the alert travels vehicle-to-vehicle, so it keeps working where mobile data is weak.</li><li><b>Raspberry Pi 4 over a bare MCU:</b> enough compute to handle GPS parsing, routing data and radio on one board, with room to grow into a product-level build.</li><li><b>Route-aware alerts:</b> sharing the planned path, not just position, lets receivers judge whether the ambulance is actually coming their way.</li></ul></div><div class="panel p-block reveal full"><h3>My journey with it</h3><p>Vector Aid began as a group project. After that first build it became my final-year project, and it has grown into the Raspberry Pi 4 based system described here.</p><div class="note">Built as a team. Tools used: Raspberry Pi 4 Model B, nRF24L01, NEO-M8N GPS, MPU6050, Python, OpenRouteService API.</div></div></div>
    <div class="p-nav">
      <a class="panel" href="stm32-fault.html"><small>← Previous</small><b>Industrial Fault Monitoring (STM32)</b></a>
      <a class="panel" href="suma-tex.html"><small>Next →</small><b>SUMA-TEX</b></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
