<title>Gas Detection & Emergency Shutdown | Rajeswari T</title>
<meta name="description" content="Arduino-based LPG leak detection with alarm and automatic servo valve shutdown. Top 5 in a mini project competition.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#020604">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="../assets/logo.svg">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
