<title>SUMA-TEX: Textile Predictive Maintenance | Rajeswari T</title>
<meta name="description" content="SUMA-TEX: multimodal ESP32-S3 condition monitoring for textile power-looms.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#020604">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="../assets/logo.svg">
