<!-- ============ ABOUT ============ -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal">01 · About</div>
    <h2 class="title reveal d1">Building hardware that <em>listens, senses and reacts.</em></h2>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="panel about-text reveal">
        <p>I'm <strong>Rajeswari</strong>, a B.E. Electronics and Communication Engineering student (2023–2027) focused on <strong>embedded systems and VLSI fundamentals</strong>.</p>
        <p>My work sits where circuits meet code: reading sensors through ADCs, writing firmware for <strong>STM32, ESP32-S3, Arduino and Raspberry Pi</strong>, and shaping raw signals into decisions a machine or a driver can act on.</p>
        <p>Industry training with <strong>NSIC</strong> in embedded AI/IoT and PLC-based industrial automation has shown me how these systems behave outside the lab, and I'm looking for a team where I can keep building them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="panel stat reveal d1"><div class="num" data-count="8.05">0</div><div class="lbl">CGPA · B.E. ECE</div></div>
