      <!-- SUMA-TEX -->
      <a href="projects/suma-tex.html" class="panel card reveal">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="card-idx">P/02</span><span class="badge">EDGE AI · IoT</span></div>
        <h3>SUMA-TEX: Predictive Maintenance for Textile MSMEs</h3>
        <p>An ESP32-S3 system that listens to power-looms through vibration, sound, temperature and current, flagging faults before a breakdown stops production.</p>
        <div class="tags"><span>ESP32-S3</span><span>MPU6050</span><span>MAX9814</span><span>DS18B20</span><span>SCT-013</span><span>FastAPI</span></div>
