        <div class="card-top"><span class="card-idx">P/03</span><span class="badge gold">TOP 5 · MINI PROJECT</span></div>
        <h3>Advanced Gas Detection &amp; Emergency Shutdown</h3>
        <p>Arduino-based LPG leak detector that raises an alarm and physically shuts the gas line through a servo-driven valve the moment levels cross a safe threshold.</p>
        <div class="tags"><span>Arduino Uno</span><span>MQ-6</span><span>Servo</span><span>LCD</span><span>Embedded C</span></div>
